        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-4 mb-2">Premium</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-snug">Complex full-scale trust setup with reservation or inquiry integrations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-sm text-zinc-500 line-through">₹30,000+</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">40% OFF</span>
